### 1. Task Overview
- **Project**: Mochi Bot V1 firmware implementation for an ESP32-S3 companion bot using PlatformIO (Arduino framework).
- **Core Request**: Implement firmware milestone-by-milestone based on the confirmed electrical schematic (`hardware_reference/mochi-bot-s3-wiring-diagram.pdf`), `GEMINI.md`, and `docs/`.
- **Approved Hardware Architecture & Pin Map**:
  - **MCU**: ESP32-S3 SuperMini (Nologo-style). Native USB CDC on GPIO19 (D−) / GPIO20 (D+).
  - **Display**: 1.3″ 128×64 Monochrome I²C OLED (SH1106) on GPIO8 (SDA) / GPIO9 (SCL) at 3.3 V.
